      "created_at": "2015-01-11T04:17:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Guise plays Lemme See That on a piece of equipment.&nbsp; Later, that equipment is destroyed.&nbsp; What happens to the \"Lemme See That\" card?</p><p>A) It's destroyed.</p><p>B) It stays where it was, although nothing is next t it now.</p><p>C) It moves next to the trash pile that the equipment is in.</p><p>The difference between B and C is just cosmetic, I suspect, but if there's a good argument for A, that could make a difference in some situations.</p><p>In any case, it's pretty clear that Guise can't use that equipment any more.</p>",
